export anchor GridTemplateColumns:
    description:
        Defines the columns of the grid: how many there are and how wide each one is. Lines between them may be named in square brackets.

    identifier: gridTemplateColumns

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `grid-template-columns` property.

    values:
        - `none`
        - `<track-size> ...`
        - `repeat(<count>, <track-size>)`
        - `repeat(auto-fill, <track-size>)`
        - `repeat(auto-fit, <track-size>)`
        - `[<line-name>] <track-size> ...`

    initial: none

    appliesTo: Grid containers.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            gridTemplateColumns: repeat(3, 1fr)
        \\\
        ```
